    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know people call it derealization but it doesn't feel like a \"condition.\" it feels like the truth. like the physical world is just this heavy, buggy layer over some actual code. i spend all day looking at pixels and i feel like i'm becoming them. just a bunch of noise that doesn't mean anything. like why am i even still processing if there's nothing actually there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
